      "content": "i just don't want to deal with a whole hospital trip if it's nothing. can't i just take something for the swelling or something like a diuretic to help with the water weight? or maybe just some extra electrolytes and keep my feet up? i really think i could just sleep it off if i stay hydrated. what do you think?",
